{"@type":"Question","name":"Will platforms punish me for using AI?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Platforms punish mass-produced minimal-human-input content and unlabeled realistic synthetic media — not AI-assisted work. AI-written hooks, scripts and captions are explicitly exempt from labels on the major platforms, and content that passes human editorial review sits in the EU AI Act's disclosure carve-out. The review-first loop in this box is exactly the pattern the rules reward."}},
